==English==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|twi|light|t1=double, half-|lang=en}}, literally ‘second light, half-light’, from {{ang}} {{term|tweoneleoht|twēonelēoht|twilight|lang=ang}}. Cognate to {{nds}} {{term|twelecht|lang=nds}}, {{de}} {{term|Zwielicht|lang=de}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈtwaɪlait/}}
* {{audio|en-us-twilight.ogg|Audio (US)}}

